                "Zaveri" ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition>
                "Using trust ontologies that assigns trust values that can be transferred from known to unknown data using: (i) content-based methods (from content or rules) and (ii) metadata-based methods (based on reputation assignments, user ratings, and provenance, rather than the content itself)."@en ;
        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme>
                <https://emmanuelawe51.github.io/dqkg/> ;
